	(text "Vout = 0.8 V x (1 + 100k/31.6k) = 3.33 V (ST1S10 VFB 0.784..0.816 V); dividers 1%.\nST1S10: 2.5..18 V in, 3 A, synchronous, 900 kHz (SYNC to GND), INH tied to VIN (on), no BOOT.\nL101 FXL0630-4R7-M: 4.7 uH, Isat 9 A, DCR 33 mOhm; C103 is the VIN_A bypass.\nCout 3 x 22u/10V X5R (C104, C105, C401); verify load-step response. C106 is NOT fitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 119.38 0)
